abstract: >-
  Low-cost two-axis computerised system for measuring antenna radiation
  patterns at 868 MHz, developed as a BSc final project at the Polytechnic
  Institute of Bragança. Includes the Arduino firmware, MATLAB acquisition
  (2D and 3D modes) and commissioning tests, raw measurement data, VNA
  characterisation of the RF chain, CST/NEC simulations and the 3D-printable
  mechanical design.
